    "explanation": "Although not particularly vulnerable to any specific Hero himself, Uther tends to struggle against sustain damage, particularly over an area of effect, as his healing is powerful, but ultimately inefficient. His sub-par waveclear can also be problematic if your team composition does not make up for this weakness somewhere else."
