        "name": "Warhead Junction"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Thanks to his burst healing, Uther prefers Maps where it is possible to secure the Objective after winning a quick team fight (such as Infernal Shrines) and that always get to the late game when he can shine more.\n\nDue to his poor Mana efficiency and lack of area of effect healing, Uther does not perform well on Maps that involve long battles that expose his team to poke damage, especially during the early game (such as Braxis Holdout)."
  },
